  "content": "<p>您是否一直夢想擁有一個更銳利、更鮮豔、更精緻的Minecraft，同時又不失其像素藝術靈魂？不用再找了。Tazko's Fresh Textures 終極材質包，將以乾淨清新的美學風格，為您的世界注入全新活力。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1487276/description_acd9a106-44d6-47e1-bac1-e38c132c6080.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"815\" height=\"113\"></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>木製工具</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1487276/description_0ef0fe74-bd8e-418c-8716-6c25aac8c8dc.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" height=\"370\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>石製工具</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1487276/description_128d85b1-0ec0-4da2-8c9b-0c2ba2acc452.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" height=\"370\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>鐵製工具</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1487276/description_6d9e92c8-84f1-4c26-a965-1ddfd5357877.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" height=\"370\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>銅製工具（僅限1.21.9或更高版本）</p>\n<p>&nbsp;- 隨著物品耐久度而氧化</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1487276/description_82bf4519-709a-4a97-8d3e-f728df79e9ad.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" height=\"370\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>金製工具</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1487276/description_9c5c358a-fd04-4511-bd83-7326ed6c3cb2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" height=\"370\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>鑽石工具</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1487276/description_57729a47-e0b1-434d-a45d-542b2eecc009.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" height=\"370\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>獄髓工具</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1487276/description_f718bee7-ded2-4e4f-bffa-85e9f3c7d57e.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" height=\"370\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1487276/description_00cd6545-5936-4d03-9809-ace0ab98a985.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" height=\"370\"></p><p>- 若要切換設定，例如在「普通模式」或「PVP模式」（較短的劍等）之間切換，或更改字體類型（共有4種新字體），<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/respackopts\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Respackopts</a> 這個模組非常重要。</p>",
